        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger </strong>An enemy within 30 feet uses a move action or leaves a square during a move action it's using.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The creature must succeed at a <strong>#Hazard 2-16 HDC#</strong> @Check[type:fortitude|dc:HDC] save or its move action is disrupted. It takes a -1 circumstance penalty to this save if it's wearing metal armor or holding a metal object, and on a critical failure is pushed 10 feet away from the Masked Core.</p>\n<div data-visibility=\"gm\">\n<p>In Tier 5, the masked core gains an extra reaction at the start of its turn, which it can only use for Thunderstruck.</p>\n</div>"
