      "stealth": {
        "details": "<p>Level:&nbsp;<strong>Average Party Level (rounded down)</strong></p>\n<p>HP: &nbsp;<strong>#Hazard 2-15 HP#&nbsp;</strong>(use the maximum value)</p>\n<p>Hardness: &nbsp;<strong>#Hazard 2-15 Hardness#&nbsp;</strong>(use the minimum value)</p>\n<p>AC: <strong>#Hazard 2-15 LAC#</strong></p>\n<p>Fortitude: <strong>#Hazard 2-15 L save#</strong></p>\n<p>Reflex: <strong>#Hazard 2-15 H Save#</strong></p>\n<p>Initiative: Set its iniative bonus to&nbsp;<strong>#Hazard 2-13 High# minus 10</strong>, which will affect its Stealth DC. <em>Its actual Stealth DC is 0.</em></p>",
        "value": 11
      }
    },
    "details": {
      "description": "<p>An orb charged with magnetic energy floats behind a large metallic mask.</p>\n<p>Upon being disabled or destroyed, the orb goes dormant or crumbles, but the mask remains intact, totally impervious to the players' onslaught.</p>",
      "disable": "<p>Arcana, Nature or Thievery DC <strong>#Hazard 2-13 High#</strong>. <br>Three successes are required to disable this hazard.</p>\n<p>Two successes make it lose the <strong>Its Electric</strong> action, it will use <strong>Lightning Strikes</strong> a second time instead.</p>",
      "isComplex": true,
      "level": {
        "value": 2
      },
      "publication": {
        "authors": "",
        "license": "ORC",
        "remaster": true,
        "title": ""
      },
      "reset": "",
      "routine": "<p>(2 actions) The trap uses its first action to use <strong>It's Electric</strong> on an ally, and its second action to use <strong>Lightning Strikes</strong> on a different ally.</p>\n<p>In Tier 4 and 5, the trap uses a third action to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.cS9nfDRGD83bNU1p]{Fly} up to 30 feet toward an ally or away from an enemy.</p>"
